			"notes": "This is a big release.\n## Fixes\n- IMBlocker+preedit crash game in 26.1+\n- 1.20.1 incorrectly requires Java 21\n- ...\n## New Features\n- Support to set window icon on KDE Wayland\n- Screenshot nearest neighbour downscale and adjustable compression level\n## Changes\n- Changed the implementation method of IMBlocker compat, now requires IMBlocker 5.5.3+/6.1.3+/7.1.3+, and removed macOS IMBlocker compat due to the lack of testers\n- Offload Screenshot saving to Util.ioPool. Now screenshot has near zero game freeze time\n- The game will auto switch to ext linear tf if it's available and we are using RGBA16F window\n## Note\nThis marks that the project has entered maintenance mode. Probably no new features will be added."
		},
