			"notes": "This is a medium feature update and bugfix.\n## Features Added\n* Auto disable early window control by @rrtt217 in https://github.com/rrtt217/Minecraft-HDR-Mod/commit/a36c5e23a2cb0fbdc1e4f283feeb3577edd07b3a (Only for 1.21.10/11, on older version it is not early enough so the game crashed before auto disable);\n* Enhanced IME Experience by @rrtt217 in https://github.com/rrtt217/Minecraft-HDR-Mod/commit/b6deac1358e4d4ec6d172b5fd52e63ef532f87d3.\n## Fixes\n* Add Ixeris Support by @CommandGenius in https://github.com/rrtt217/Minecraft-HDR-Mod/pull/49\n## Note\nTo make it compatible with Create: Aeronautics or its dependency Sable, please open its [Sable](https://modrinth.com/mod/sable)'s jar using a zip archive manager, find `veil-neoforge-1.21.1-3.6.0.jar` in `META-INF/jarjar`, open it again using zip archive manager, and delete `\"client.PerformanceRenderTargetMixin\",` in `veil.performance.mixins.json`.\nOr you can seperately install 3.6.2 version of Veil, which fixed the compatibility. Thanks for their quick response!\n## New Contributors\n* @CommandGenius made their first contribution in https://github.com/rrtt217/Minecraft-HDR-Mod/pull/49\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/rrtt217/Minecraft-HDR-Mod/compare/v2.1.0...v2.1.1"
		},
