			"notes": "This is a medium feature update.\n# What's new\n- Windows Intel support by @rrtt217 and @moyongxin.\n    - We utilizes `WGL_NV_DX_interop2`, making OpenGL do offscreen rendering and DirectX 11 do presentation. \n    - For Windows Intel, Performance degradation compared to no HDR Mod is expected.\n    - This also enables maximum brightness retrieval, HDR10/PQ presentation (save bandwidth), (maybe) lower latency (we have Hardware Composed: Independent Flip), and seamless multitasking just like borderless window.\n    - IME seems to be broken for Windows (not sure from what version), install [caramelChat](https://modrinth.com/mod/caramel-chat) to fix, and IME cadidate bar can work on DXGI mode even for fullscreen.\n# Fixes\n- Moved the injection point of Iris macros, improving compatibility with other mods;\n- Fixed Replay Mod Rendering process screen do not get color transformed on 1.21.1."
		}
